                            <comment id="15728884" author="iveselovskiy" created="Wed, 7 Dec 2016 14:22:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Shall we also invoke org.apache.ignite.internal.client.GridClientFactory#stopAll() ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15731838" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 8 Dec 2016 10:54:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ivan,&lt;br/&gt;
I would prefer to have more clean way to clear client map - do that when client is closed. We should use method &lt;tt&gt;IgniteHadoopClientProtocolProvider.close&lt;/tt&gt; for this.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Concurrency should be scalable enough.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15733222" author="iveselovskiy" created="Thu, 8 Dec 2016 19:45:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;reimplemented. TC tests passed. &lt;br/&gt;
branch &quot;ignite-4341-4386&quot; contains both  the fixes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
