&lt;p&gt;Currently one closed protocol will close GridClient for all other protocols created from the same provider, what is not correct.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15735739" author="iveselovskiy" created="Fri, 9 Dec 2016 16:40:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed. Tests passed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
